Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:21:59.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(462,0)\frz270\bord0\pos(1070,247)}『蟻穴之計
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:21:59.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(462,0)\frz270\bord0.8\blur12\1a&HFF&\3c&H836369&\pos(1070,600)}陰謀之始』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:21:59.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(462,0)\frz270\bord0\alpha&H255&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1070,600)}陰{\c&HD1B5B8&}謀{\c&HB28586&}之{\c&HE99FA8&}始』
